    "sections": {
        "en": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "heading",
                    "attrs": {
                        "level": 2
                    },
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Signed-in sessions"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "If you sign in to a Pherus account at account.pherus.org, that subdomain sets its own session cookie to keep you signed in. You can review and revoke your active sessions at any time from your account's security settings."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "heading",
                    "attrs": {
                        "level": 2
                    },
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Managing cookies"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Most browsers let you block or delete cookies in their settings. Blocking the locale cookie just means we can't remember your language choice between visits — nothing else on this site depends on it."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "heading",
                    "attrs": {
                        "level": 2
                    },
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Changes to this policy"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "If what we store ever changes, we'll update this page and the date above."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        "zh": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "heading",
                    "attrs": {
                        "level": 2
                    },
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "已登录的会话"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "如果您登录 account.pherus.org 上的 Pherus 账户,该子域名会设置自己的会话 cookie 以保持您的登录状态。您可以随时在账户的安全设置中查看并撤销您的活动会话。"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "heading",
                    "attrs": {
                        "level": 2
                    },
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "管理 cookie"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "大多数浏览器都允许您在设置中阻止或删除 cookie。阻止语言 cookie 只是意味着我们无法记住您在两次访问之间的语言选择——本网站的其他功能不依赖于它。"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "heading",
                    "attrs": {
                        "level": 2
                    },
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "本政策的变更"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "如果我们存储的内容发生变化,我们会更新本页面及上方的日期。"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        "fr": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "heading",
                    "attrs": {
                        "level": 2
                    },
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Sessions connectées"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Si vous vous connectez à un compte Pherus sur account.pherus.org, ce sous-domaine dépose son propre cookie de session pour vous garder connecté. Vous pouvez consulter et révoquer vos sessions actives à tout moment depuis les paramètres de sécurité de votre compte."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "heading",
                    "attrs": {
                        "level": 2
                    },
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Gérer les cookies"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "La plupart des navigateurs vous permettent de bloquer ou de supprimer les cookies dans leurs paramètres. Bloquer le cookie de langue signifie simplement que nous ne pouvons plus mémoriser votre choix de langue d'une visite à l'autre — rien d'autre sur ce site n'en dépend."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "heading",
                    "attrs": {
                        "level": 2
                    },
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Modifications de cette politique"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Si ce que nous stockons venait à changer, nous mettrions à jour cette page ainsi que la date ci-dessus."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    },
